      "params": {
        "text": "Grids and vec2 spreads\n\n`Grid Spread` emits a Spread<vec2> — one (x,y) per cell. Pass it into a ForEach: inside the region each slot is one vec2, which wires straight into a shape's `pos`.\n\nResult: an 8×8 grid of circles.",
        "width": 380,
        "height": 240
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Grids and vec2 spreads\n\n`Grid Spread` emits a Spread<vec2> — one (x,y) per cell. Pass it into a ForEach: inside the region each slot is one vec2, which wires straight into a shape's `pos`.\n\nResult: an 8×8 grid of circles.",
